    <briefdescription>
<para>Interface every shard participant must implement for 2PC coordination. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Concrete implementations may wrap an in-process <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_m_v_c_c_store" kindref="compound">MVCCStore</ref> or a remote RPC stub (gRPC). Returning false from <ref refid="classthemis_1_1storage_1_1_i_distributed_shard_participant_1ae4a47dd6b4afc320f0a5170650fad4f4" kindref="member">prepare()</ref> votes ABORT for the entire transaction. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
